1
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:12,887
Hey, Seung-hyun!
Did everything go well today?

2
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:14,305
Yes.

3
00:00:14,305 --> 00:00:16,391
Great. You can keep coming
at this time every day.

4
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:19,060
Just drop by whenever
it's easiest for you.

5
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,022
Okay, thank you.

6
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:24,163
Good work today.

7
00:00:30,405 --> 00:00:32,547
Hey, I'm back.

8
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:36,327
So, how did the treatment go?

9
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:37,912
It was okay.

10
00:00:37,912 --> 00:00:40,081
Glad to hear that.
What was it like?

11
00:00:40,081 --> 00:00:41,681
[Wild Stallion]
At first, it was tough

12
00:00:41,682 --> 00:00:43,876
and didn't feel like much...

13
00:00:43,877 --> 00:00:45,795
Yeah?

14
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:48,965
But during the session
it felt kind of... weird.

15
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:51,968
Weird? What do you mean?

16
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:56,890
I don't know.
I just felt a bit tense...

17
00:00:57,223 --> 00:00:59,059
and kind of ticklish.

18
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,062
You're pretty ticklish, huh?

19
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:07,067
Maybe. I didn't
think I was, though.

20
00:01:07,067 --> 00:01:10,070
Well, it was my first time
doing therapy.

21
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:12,572
You're probably
just not used to it yet.

22
00:01:12,572 --> 00:01:13,907
Keep going
and give it some time.

23
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:19,126
[Wild Stallion]
